- Harden transferable adaptor arkoor packages
  Public transfer verification now rejects duplicate or conflicting inputs, duplicate outputs, and amount overflows before a wallet relies on an adaptor-locked package. Wire decoding rejects unrepresentable output totals before builder arithmetic.
  Reuse Taproot policies and MuSig public-key aggregation to reduce swap verification and completion work. All signature and full-genesis checks remain in place.
